  "title": {
   "en": "Little Hollow Café"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "When Mimi moves from the big city to quaint Little Hollow to take over her grandmother's café, she expects a sleepy, quiet town... but nobody warned her about the fae lurking around every corner! While it's every bit as cozy as her grandmother described it, it is also full of magic, secrets, and ridiculously cute people. Can Mimi uncover the magical secrets hidden within Little Hollow? And will she be able to pay rent at the end of the month?"
  },
